  "details": "There is an open source set of software tools called \"Impacket\" that has been recently used to load malicious ransomware onto PC's using other Kernel-level anticheat. \nhttps://www.pcgamer.com/ransomware-abuses-genshin-impacts-kernel-mode-anti-cheat-to-bypass-antivirus-protection/\nI highly reccomend doing your best to make sure your build of EAC doesn't use any modules that involve code-signing as a driver. \nBasically using these tools malicious actors can remotely disable anticheat on a user's PC and inject ransomware thereafter.",
